Package: secubox-backup
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox Backup — config + LXC-container backup manager
 Backup manager covering SecuBox configs (/etc/secubox, nginx,
 wireguard, haproxy, nftables), service data (/var/lib/secubox,
 nextcloud, gitea), and LXC containers with automatic stop/start
 around snapshots. Web dashboard with stats and history.
